67af105068ac4a4abc2e2966bd0e9732 3x"}, "body": "ちとせ千世先生 はじめまして！\n\n私の友達はあなたの絵が大好きなので、彼女にイラストを描いてもいいですか。\n月之霜：\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1SYAnGsIsOMST4VGKUHOXy7rcf1RsRfQS/view?usp=drive_link\nまた可能でしたらデータはpsdで、キャラと背景のレイヤーを分けて頂けますと幸いです。\nよろしくお願いいたします！", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@chitochiyo__/works/15", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2659448, "client_id": 76306, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/adf08a8f/uploads/origins/9d17997e-20e0-4fcb-96bf-c7481be58e58?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=684112c879aee9c0957ea492dd075a50", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/adf08a8f/uploads/origins/9d17997e-20e0-4fcb-96bf-c7481be58e58?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=684112c879aee9c0957ea492dd075a50, https://si.imgix.net/adf08a8f/uploads/origins/9d17997e-20e0-4fcb-96bf-c7481be58e58?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fda5210f1ff7b4eca18597cb9ddfccae 2x, https://si.imgix.net/adf08a8f/uploads/origins/9d17997e-20e0-4fcb-96bf-c7481be58e58?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=88977952506fe521684e118b0c824f8d 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": true, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/adf08a8f/uploads/origins/9d17997e-20e0-4fcb-96bf-c7481be58e58?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=888a3b7c4798f619dcd852de122861e1", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/adf08a8f/uploads/origins/9d17997e-20e0-4fcb-96bf-c7481be58e58?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=888a3b7c4798f619dcd852de122861e1, https://si.imgix.net/adf08a8f/uploads/origins/9d17997e-20e0-4fcb-96bf-c7481be58e58?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop